{"file_name": "CoverLogo_Landscape.png", "id": "616531301220959", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391901_616531307887625_1642505082054004162_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MN6fTT5rJi8Q7kNvwEuR_qT&_nc_oc=AdpgVmhNnyQ72OeqB7QZis3Wfpwd291HQ3VR9kGJy4pqw1eu-35CDLydy6aDzWK662U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTkndg_hB-TzYl8ijtuSw7XAqHj3bcDHytcFdw6V-S94w&oe=6B05BEC3"}, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "short_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/varcher-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meatspace Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9288582014561158"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391982_1157053902725846_5331939399669786939_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qjyn0AEBAf0Q7kNvwHYowG1&_nc_oc=Adov5z9zFkLRzELSQN7U_KLQeOPfVO3Bwe_IbgpZP1Uy9Ep01SmAK-aU-P2FQQEEaD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSC052Z-C71TZQN1WCsnbUrKNZVVAulRe_Ry7IME0z1BA&oe=6B05CB3E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "vArcher", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sports", "id": "2776542286000603"}, {"topic_name": "Fitness & Wellness", "id": "810139357995560"}, {"topic_name": "Hands-On Training", "id